00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner is Temari.</font>

32
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm tired...</font>

33
00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, what a waste!</font>

34
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! He had a chance to
become a Chunin!</font>

35
00:02:07,890 --> 00:02:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru is Shikamaru...</font>

36
00:02:13,730 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really... Does he or doesn't he
have the motivation?</font>

37
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:21,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I'm not sure about it.</font>

38
00:02:23,410 --> 00:02:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But his intelligence and strategies
are no longer at the Genin level.</font>

39
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it had been an actual mission
for a basic platoon,</font>

40
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:38,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the win was decided when
he captured Temari...</font>

41
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I suppose he won the competition,
but he lost the match...</font>

42
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate he shows no
signs of being motivated,</font>

43
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the other hand, he won't get too
emotional or fall into a panic.</font>

44
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:56,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's exactly why...</font>

45
00:02:57,070 --> 00:03:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he'd be able to calmly pull back if
he viewed a situation as totally hopeless.</font>

46
00:03:02,370 --> 00:03:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That could be attributed to
calm judgment.</font>

47
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru probably possesses...</font>

48
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:13,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the most important psychological
element required for a Chunin...</font>

49
00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the disposition of a leader!</font>

50
00:03:25,810 --> 00:03:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to evaluate someone
as a leader of a platoon...</font>

51
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's much more important to
protect the platoon from danger,</font>

52
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">than to carry out a mission.</font>

53
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... it'd hardly be worth mentioning
a completed mission</font>

54
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if everyone was annihilated.</font>

55
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The risks and the mission
should be put on a scale,</font>

56
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">surviving should be thought of first,
and then action should be taken.</font>

57
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person who can't do this isn't
qualified to become a Chunin.</font>

58
00:03:50,410 --> 00:03:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga and Naruto from earlier
fail on that point.</font>

59
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:03,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although they are all right
as insignificant Genin.</font>

60
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I do feel like Shikamaru
gave up too soon too.</font>

61
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think?</font>

62
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do I feel...?</font>

63
00:04:17,230 --> 00:04:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has more of a chance
than Naruto, for sure!</font>

64
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap...!</font>

65
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why the hell did he give up!</font>

66
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he an idiot?!</font>

67
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This ticks me off!</font>

68
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna really give him
a lecture!</font>

69
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the one that's gonna
become a Chunin is...</font>

70
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

71
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, super idiot!</font>

72
00:04:45,550 --> 00:04:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why the hell did you give up?!</font>

73
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's not talk about that anymore,
all right?</font>

74
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not all right! It was a match
you were close to winning!</font>

75
00:04:56,900 --> 00:05:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's just watch the next match.
— But you just gave up! Unimaginable!</font>

76
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Simply unimaginable!</font>

77
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? The next match?</font>

78
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

79
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Clash!</font>

80
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Moment</font>

81
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Leaf Dances</font>

82
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and the</font>

83
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sand Wriggles!</font>

84
00:05:21,670 --> 00:05:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last, Uchiha's match is next.</font>

85
00:05:24,010 --> 00:05:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, but who's this opponent Gaara?</font>

86
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder...</font>

87
00:05:28,300 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But compared to Uchiha,
he's nothing much.</font>

88
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know?</font>

89
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear Uchiha's gonna
withdraw from this match.</font>

90
00:05:38,150 --> 00:05:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?!</font>

91
00:05:39,610 --> 00:05:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, he apparently sustained a serious
injury while training before the match...</font>

92
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you serious?</font>

93
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to think I took time off
specifically to see this match!</font>

94
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, come on!</font>

95
00:05:52,990 --> 00:05:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you'd expect, this match
will be won by Uchiha.</font>

96
00:05:57,210 --> 00:06:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way, I've got high hope
for the new one of the Sand.</font>

97
00:06:01,670 --> 00:06:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't let this one slip by.</font>

98
00:06:06,170 --> 00:06:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As they say about the world
of competition...</font>

99
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:13,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible to predict
what will occur...</font>

100
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama, about Uchiha Sasuke,</font>

101
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has not yet arrived at the arena.</font>

102
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm... it's unavoidable...</font>

103
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't make the guests
wait any longer.</font>

104
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another ten minutes.</font>

105
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we wait just
another ten minutes?</font>

106
00:07:09,150 --> 00:07:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

107
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guests are looking forward
to the next match above all else.</font>

108
00:07:15,450 --> 00:07:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cancelling it would be cruel.</font>

109
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,
waiting another ten minutes wouldn't hurt.</font>

110
00:07:25,130 --> 00:07:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama...?</font>

111
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm...</font>

112
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha, where are you!</font>

113
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's keeping you?
Hurry up!</font>

114
00:07:33,590 --> 00:07:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is some truth to what
Kazekage-dono says.</font>

115
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So shall we extend it for
ten minutes from now.</font>

116
00:07:48,230 --> 00:07:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... let Genma know of this.</font>

117
00:07:51,990 --> 00:07:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

118
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it stays like this, Uchiha will really
be forced to withdraw.</font>

119
00:08:07,130 --> 00:08:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... a ten-minute extension...</font>

120
00:08:16,010 --> 00:08:16,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

121
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, isn't that...</font>

122
00:08:38,740 --> 00:08:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are...</font>

123
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, what's that idiot doing!
He's still not here?!</font>

124
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...!</font>

125
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please!</font>

126
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good of the two of you to make it!</font>

127
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come now, hurry into the arena!</font>

128
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

129
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Here we go!</font>

130
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:12,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Yeah!</font>

131
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most of the first round is finished,</font>

132
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the only one left is
Uchiha Sasuke and Gaara.</font>

133
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:23,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-How about Naruto-kun and
Neji's match...?!</font>

134
00:09:24,210 --> 00:09:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the interesting thing is...</font>

135
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Hyuga lost...</font>

136
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun beat Neji...</font>

137
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

138
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

139
00:09:58,820 --> 00:09:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

140
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:03,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're such a...
good guy really...</font>

141
00:10:04,950 --> 00:10:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What's going on with the next match!
— Let's get on with it!</font>

142
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't Uchiha up yet?!</font>

143
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We want Uchiha! Uchiha!</font>

144
00:10:11,130 --> 00:10:12,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha!</font>

145
00:10:14,710 --> 00:10:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, it's almost time.</font>

146
00:10:17,170 --> 00:10:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he really gonna come?!</font>

147
00:10:19,970 --> 00:10:20,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll come...</font>

148
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll definitely come!</font>

149
00:10:33,230 --> 00:10:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh Sasuke, what's he doing!</font>

150
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is Uchiha doing?!</font>

151
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems the rumor that
he'd had a serious injury was true.</font>

152
00:10:47,830 --> 00:10:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's a win by default,
then this match is mine.</font>

153
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thirty more seconds...</font>

154
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha!</font>

155
00:11:08,980 --> 00:11:11,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... please come!</font>

156
00:11:11,730 --> 00:11:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

157
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and come!</font>

158
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't be good if it stays this way!</font>

159
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time limit is up.</font>

160
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is it.</font>

161
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because the time limit has expired,
the last match...</font>

162
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See... Here he is...</font>

163
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm sorry we're late...</font>

164
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasu...</font>

165
00:12:22,930 --> 00:12:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your name?</font>

166
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... Sasuke.</font>

167
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... Sasuke.</font>

168
00:12:39,610 --> 00:12:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

169
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like he made it in time.</font>

170
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san!</font>

171
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... Causing others
this much trouble...</font>

172
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and thinking himself so important!</font>

173
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! You're pretty late!</font>

174
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you weren't coming
'cause you were scared to take me on!</font>

175
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell was it that
said he'd come for sure?</font>

176
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:08,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first round... did you win?</font>

177
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course!</font>

178
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get too carried away...</font>

179
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Useless!</font>

180
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I know it's somewhat rude
to be showing up all flashy like this...</font>

181
00:13:27,070 --> 00:13:28,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but was Sasuke...</font>

182
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">disqualified?</font>

183
00:13:34,790 --> 00:13:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So your habit of tardiness
rubbed off on him?</font>

184
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... what about it?</font>

185
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right, Sasuke's match
has been postponed anyway.</font>

186
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your arrival was barely in time, but...</font>

187
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he hasn't been disqualified.</font>

188
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:55,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good to hear!</font>

189
00:14:06,490 --> 00:14:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lose to a guy like that!</font>

190
00:14:09,490 --> 00:14:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

191
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight you too...</font>

192
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

193
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want... to fight you too!</font>

194
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

195
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay, Sasuke-kun!</font>

196
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:41,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha's match is gonna start!</font>

197
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:44,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru gave it so much,
but already it's Sasuke...</font>

198
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Poor Shikamaru...</font>

199
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is that Uchiha?</font>

200
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:51,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just second fiddle...</font>

201
00:14:52,530 --> 00:14:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess that's just
the way it goes...</font>

202
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm looking forward to it too.</font>

203
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:02,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your team is sort of amazing, Sakura.</font>

204
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is?</font>

205
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, Naruto did beat that
Hyuga Neji and...</font>

206
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:10,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun is an elite member
of the Uchiha...</font>

207
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it seems like everyone's
anxious to see Sasuke-kun's match.</font>

208
00:15:19,810 --> 00:15:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun will face that Gaara
of the Sand whom I couldn't beat...</font>

209
00:15:25,190 --> 00:15:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Naruto-kun beat that Neji
that I had hoped to take down.</font>

210
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it so...</font>

211
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why am I so...</font>

212
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">frustrated!</font>

213
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...!</font>

214
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last...</font>

215
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara, come down here!</font>

216
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:29,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Let's go up!</font>

217
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

218
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we go up,
we'll leisurely take the stairs.</font>

219
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with you!</font>

220
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still upset that
I pushed you down?!</font>

221
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This isn't good...</font>

222
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been quite awhile
since I've seen Gaara like this.</font>

223
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey... Gaara.</font>

224
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep the strategy in mind...!</font>

225
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk to Gaara right now!</font>

226
00:17:09,630 --> 00:17:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be killed.</font>

227
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

228
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

229
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hurry up!</font>

230
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing good's gonna happen
in your life if you panic.</font>

231
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

232
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

233
00:17:50,290 --> 00:17:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Low-level tournaments like this
Chunin Examination are ideal</font>

234
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as gambling matches.</font>

235
00:17:57,300 --> 00:18:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A number of feudal lords
are here for that purpose.</font>

236
00:18:01,350 --> 00:18:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... would you lose this match for us.</font>

237
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come on,
at least give us an answer.</font>

238
00:18:22,330 --> 00:18:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too scared to say anything...</font>

239
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Help!</font>

240
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop! Stop!</font>

241
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If those two in front of us
hadn't been there,</font>

242
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we probably would've been killed...</font>

243
00:20:42,630 --> 00:20:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the first I've seen anyone
kill people without hesitation like that...</font>

244
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't looking good
even for Sasuke.</font>

245
00:20:51,390 --> 00:20:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

246
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So now... at last...</font>

247
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

248
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

249
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

250
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

251
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

252
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

253
00:21:44,930 --> 00:21:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

254
00:21:44,930 --> 00:21:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

255
00:21:50,130 --> 00:21:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

256
00:21:50,130 --> 00:21:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

257
00:21:55,340 --> 00:21:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

258
00:21:55,340 --> 00:21:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

259
00:21:58,970 --> 00:22:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

260
00:21:58,970 --> 00:22:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

261
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

262
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

263
00:22:10,950 --> 00:22:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

264
00:22:10,950 --> 00:22:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

265
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

266
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

267
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

268
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

269
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it!
What kind of guy is that?!</font>

270
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Gaara is totally not normal!
He doesn't even look at us.</font>

271
00:22:57,310 --> 00:22:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If anyone fights with him like that...</font>

272
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn! Hey Shikamaru!
We've got to go see Kakashi-sensei!</font>

273
00:23:02,730 --> 00:23:05,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">We've got to stop this fight,
no matter what!</font>

274
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The Man Who Calls Up a Storm!! Sasuke's Fuzzy Eyebrow Style Combat Move!"</font>

275
00:23:10,570 --> 00:23:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If nothing's done,
Sasuke's a goner!</font>

